[{"id":2707538108,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hYcC8","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nFor completeness' sake, here's a benchmark between `master`, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104450 and this PR applied on top of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104450:\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing an optimized editor build (`production=yes lto=full`).\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ hyperfine -iw1 -m25 \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\" \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.font-load-once --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\" \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      4.090 s ±  0.274 s    [User: 2.497 s, System: 0.609 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.251 s …  4.299 s    25 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.font-load-once --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.810 s ±  0.091 s    [User: 2.196 s, System: 0.611 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.404 s …  3.868 s    25 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 3: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --path /tmp/4 -e --quit   <---- This PR\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.708 s ±  0.322 s    [User: 2.109 s, System: 0.591 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    2.795 s …  4.235 s    25 runs\r\n \r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --path /tmp/4 -e --quit ran\r\n    1.03 ± 0.09 times faster than bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.font-load-once --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n    1.10 ± 0.12 times faster than bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455#pullrequestreview-2707538108","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T23:23:27Z"},{"id":2707536968,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hYbxI","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455#pullrequestreview-2707536968","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T23:26:01Z"},{"id":2707560847,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hYhmP","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repo